{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9KYXBhbmVzZS1MYW5ndWFnZS9UZXJyYSUyMEZvcm1hcnMlMjAlMjgyMDE2JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Terra Formars","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/z1A7bajfwadBi5eAgXiWDMpY5i9.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pPuTRbSIpTU8dDvWoyXTtNl9iAe.jpg","description":"With the space program attempting to travel to Mars, 21st century scientists were tasked with warming up the planet so that humans could survive on its surface. They came up with an efficient and cost effective plan of sending cockroaches and mold to the surface so that the mold would absorb the sunlight and the insect corpses would serve as a food source for the mold.  It is now the year 2577 and the first manned ship to Mars has landed on the planet and the six crew members are ready for their mission. But what they find are giant mutated humanoid cockroaches with incredible physical strength. The crew members are easily wiped out, but not before sending a transmission back to Earth. Now, humanity will send elite warriors to exterminate the mutated bugs and claim back Mars.\n\nReleased 29 Apr 2016 · Japan, Iceland · Language: Japanese · 109 min\nStudio: Warner Bros. Japan, Shueisha, Kyoraku Industrial Holdings\n\nOn your server — Audio: Japanese","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["Action","Horror","Science Fiction","Others"],"imdbRating":"6.1","runtime":"109 min","cast":["Hideaki Ito","Emi Takei","Tomohisa Yamashita","Takayuki Yamada","Shun Oguri","Kane Kosugi","Rinko Kikuchi","Masaya Katō"],"director":["Takashi Miike"],"released":"2016-04-29T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"We're the ones who will survive.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Takashi Miike","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/faxjG72MyCOE1NSRrZSFo4KgCIZ.jpg"},{"name":"Hideaki Ito","character":"Shokichi Komachi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rAUBx8rz1UKy2ZI1oBDXwNuPJZg.jpg"},{"name":"Emi Takei","character":"Nanao Akita",